OL,3,GNEWSAUS billionaire's mansion plans
OL,4,Aapproved on appeal
OL,5,
OL,6,FA US billionaire's plans to build a
OL,7,Fcountry house in the Cotswolds have
OL,8,Fbeen approved by the government after
OL,9,Fan appeal.
OL,11,FRonald Burkle, the man behind the Soho
OL,12,FHouse private members' club, wants to
OL,13,Fbuild on 4.37 hectares of farmland in
OL,14,FLittle Tew, Oxfordshire.
OL,16,FHis proposals were rejected by West
OL,17,FOxfordshire District Council for the
OL,18,Fsecond time in October 2025, before the
OL,19,Fbusinessman appealed to the government
OL,20,FPlanning Inspectorate.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
