OL,3,GNEWSAUS billionaire's mansion plans
OL,4,Aapproved on appeal
OL,5,
OL,6,FFollowing a five-day hearing in
OL,7,FSeptember, the Planning Inspectorate
OL,8,Freversed the council's decision and
OL,9,Fgranted the proposals full planning
OL,10,Fpermission.
